  "content": "<p>One of our members built a nice miniature TV for theatre.</p><p>For a small film set, they created a tiny television to play back clips during the show. It uses a Wemos D1 Mini (ESP8266) and a 1.44&quot; TFT display. The 3D-printed enclosure was designed in Blender. The device is controlled via OSC (UDP) and can play back small MJPG clips, still slideshows and some test patterns.</p><p>Check out the project on GitHub: <a href=\"https://github.com/sonarkon/HOPE-TV\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"\">github.com/sonarkon/HOPE-TV</span><span class=\"invisible\"></span></a></p>",
